# merge 冲突特例：given 删除、current 修改，given 段为空
> init
<<<
+ f.txt mbase.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧把 f.txt 改成新内容
+ f.txt mdel-c.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "current edits"
<<<

# given 侧删除 f.txt
> checkout other
<<<
> rm f.txt
<<<
> commit "given deletes"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
Encountered a merge conflict.
<<<

# given 段为空的五段内容
= f.txt mexpect-gdeleted.txt
